                    month: "(month)",
                    content: '<p>61 Financial Information Technology Pty Ltd (61 Financial) is a FinTech company operating a stock information platform for ASX-listed stocks, providing comprehensive market information such as stock charting and top-ranked dividends, as well as delivering advanced functions such as a StockWatch in continuously monitoring the market movements.</p>\n      <p>61 Financial has been granted with the ASX MarketSource Delayed Data Licence and ComNews Delayed Data Licence, allowing it to display stock prices and market announcements with a 20-minute delay via <a href="https://www.61financial.com.au">61financial.com.au</a>. Our data vendors and sources include the ASX, Paritech, IBISWorld, and ASIC.</p>\n      <p>The company is committed to the development of financial technology, utilising artificial intelligence through big data analysis, algorithms, and machine learning, to present market data and information in simpler, more efficient, and more intriguing ways. We are in the process of developing a Robo-advice product, providing buy sell indicators to ASX investors based on stock technical analysis. Through innovation, we endeavour to provide users with an unique experience in accessing simple and effective ASX market information.</p>\n      <p>61 Financial is also a member of the FinTech Australia.</p>',
